{"event":"step_update","step_update":{"conversation_id":"5eed54a4-cadb-4579-bc78-e9b6246c5820","step_index":132,"state":"DONE","step_type":"agent_response","text_delta":"ed in output files.\n\n---\n\n## 5. Handoff Manifest\n\nThe deterministic handoff manifest has been atomically written to [`handoff/20261013T155419-714-niq1/wayfinder-read-and-plan.txt`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-20261013T155419-714-niq1/handoff/20261013T155419-714-niq1/wayfinder-read-and-plan.txt) containing exactly one repo-relative path per line:\n```\nfunctional_specification_005.md\nwayfinder/20261013T155419-714-niq1/tickets/ticket-001.md\nwayfinder/20261013T155419-714-niq1/tickets/ticket-002.md\nwayfinder/20261013T155419-714-niq1/tickets/ticket-003.md\nwayfinder/20261013T155419-714-niq1/tickets/ticket-004.md\nwayfinder/20261013T155419-714-niq1/tickets/ticket-005.md\nwayfinder/20261013T155419-714-niq1/tickets/ticket-006.md\nwayfinder/20261013T155419-714-niq1/map.md\nwayfinder/20261013T155419-714-niq1/matrix.md\n```\n\nAll session files have been staged and committed, with `git status --porcelain` verified completely clean.\n\n\u003cpromise\u003eCOMPLETE\u003c/promise\u003e\n","duration_seconds":12.130994,"usage":{"input_tokens":5155,"output_tokens":4556,"thinking_tokens":335,"cache_read_tokens":142636,"total_tokens":9711}}}
 coding constraints or execution holds were plac{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"5eed54a4-cadb-4579-bc78-e9b6246c5820","status":"SUCCESS","response":"# /wayfinder-read-and-plan: Functional Specification Ingestion, Architectural Decision Mapping, and Edit Planning\n\n**Governing Specification:** [`functional_specification_005.md`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-20261013T155419-714-niq1/functional_specification_005.md)  \n**Run ID:** `20261013T155419-714-niq1`  \n**System Taxonomy \u0026 Evaluation Reference:** [`LANGUAGE.md`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-20261013T155419-714-niq1/LANGUAGE.md)  \n\n---\n\n## 1. Functionality Understanding Check (`/functionality-understanding-check`)\n\n### Desired `{functionality}`\nThe objective is to replace the current query routing mechanism—which is constrained to three hardcoded `if/elif` templates—with a dynamic, schema-driven **Graph Retrieval-Augmented Generation (GraphRAG)** engine across the Neo4j property graph.\n\nThe system must satisfy the following core requirements:\n1. **Dynamic Schema-Driven Traversal ($N \\ge 1$):** Traversal must not rely on `if/elif` slot combination checks. For single-entity inputs ($N = 1$, e.g., `STATE-NY` or canvas node clicks), the engine must trace direct legal, contractor, administrative, and fee lineage (`INV-UNBROKEN-ANCESTRY`). For multi-entity inputs ($N \\ge 2$), the engine must dynamically discover connecting paths and shared ancestry in Neo4j.\n2. **Clinical Indication Mediation (`INV-NO-KEYWORD-BRIDGING`):** Procedure codes ([`HCPCSCode`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-20261013T155419-714-niq1/src/graph/models.py)) and diagnosis codes ([`ICD10Code`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-20261013T155419-714-niq1/src/graph/models.py)) must connect exclusively through an authorizing [`CoveragePolicy`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-20261013T155419-714-niq1/src/graph/models.py). Direct links between procedure codes and diagnoses are strictly prohibited.\n3. **Fail-Fast Error Boundaries (`INV-FAIL-FAST`):** The system must immediately raise explicit errors (`EntityResolutionError` for unindexed terms like \"Atlantis\" or \"diabetes\"; `TraversalError` for disconnected entities) returning `HTTP 400`. Silent catch blocks, heuristic fallbacks, and dummy edges are forbidden.\n4. **Structured Five-Section Context Assembly:** Retrieve and format subgraphs into five authoritative sections (Program Authority, Contractor \u0026 Region, Clinical Criteria, Fees and Patient Costs, Data Sources \u0026 Provenance) with exact 20% patient coinsurance calculations and zero synthetic fallbacks.\n5. **Exact-Citation LLM Synthesis Grounding:** Instruct the language model ([`HuggingFaceSynthesizer`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-20261013T155419-714-niq1/src/graphrag/synthesizer.py)) to answer using exclusively facts in the graph context, quoting exact bracketed node primary keys (e.g. `[CMS-MCD-A59508]`, `[PLAW-117-328]`, `[JURIS-DME-A]`), exact reimbursement dollar figures, and official legal citations (`Public Law 117-328`, `88 FR 77676`).\n6. **Canvas Illumination Telemetry:** Synchronously emit active node primary keys and directed edge keys to highlight active paths in amber/gold and center camera focus on the UI canvas.\n\nUnderstanding is fully verified and aligned with the specification.\n\n---\n\n## 2. Wayfinder Decision Tickets Summary\n\nAll architectural and research decisions have been resolved and documented in [`wayfinder/20261013T155419-714-niq1/tickets/`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-20261013T155419-714-niq1/wayfinder/20261013T155419-714-niq1/tickets/):\n\n| Ticket | Scope | Status | Blocked By | Summary of Locked Decision |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| [`ticket-001.md`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-20261013T155419-714-niq1/wayfinder/20261013T155419-714-niq1/tickets/ticket-001.md) | Entity Resolution | RESOLVED | Root | Direct primary key token resolution (`\\b[A-Z0-9]+-[A-Z0-9\\-_.]+\\b`) across all 14 node types with Neo4j validation; 14-entity lexical matching; fail-fast `EntityResolutionError` on unindexed inputs. |\n| [`ticket-002.md`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-20261013T155419-714-niq1/wayfinder/20261013T155419-714-niq1/tickets/ticket-002.md) | Dynamic Traversal | RESOLVED | `ticket-001.md` | Elimination of `if/elif` hardcoded routing; single-entity lineage ($N=1$) for State (`STATE-NY` -\u003e Noridian Jurisdiction A -\u003e CR 13286 -\u003e Policy A59508 -\u003e non-rural NY fees) and Clinical codes; multi-entity shortest paths ($N \\ge 2$); edge provenance retention (`INV-PROVENANCE-COMPLETENESS`). |\n| [`ticket-003.md`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-20261013T155419-714-niq1/wayfinder/20261013T155419-714-niq1/tickets/ticket-003.md) | Context Assembly | RESOLVED | `ticket-002.md` | Elimination of synthetic defaults (`[POLICY-LTA]`, `CGS Administrators`, hardcoded states); assembly into five authoritative Markdown sections; dynamic 20% patient coinsurance computation. |\n| [`ticket-004.md`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-20261013T155419-714-niq1/wayfinder/20261013T155419-714-niq1/tickets/ticket-004.md) | Grounded Synthesis | RESOLVED | `ticket-003.md` | Anti-hallucination system prompt enforcing quotation of bracketed primary keys (`[CMS-MCD-A59508]`), exact dollar figures, and legal citations; operational parameters for Hugging Face Router endpoint (`https://router.huggingface.co/v1/chat/completions`). |\n| [`ticket-005.md`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-20261013T155419-714-niq1/wayfinder/20261013T155419-714-niq1/tickets/ticket-005.md) | API \u0026 Canvas Sync | RESOLVED | `ti